{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har02_title", "source_sha256": "5f96bce313815c547e25b9dd15381311abbc37695599a45683dc9b93769512e7", "ja": "春香とおでかけ2", "zh": "和春香外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ae4bf88174a7ae40e50fa4c26def3a5f34c9b9400c8f3330dd3b3fb5c9fbba3c", "ja": "春香とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和春香一起出门的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "00fe172aed7e9aa51826647db6139be066760eab5924a52e55966446ee61143e", "ja": "（春香からのリクエストで、甘味処に来た。\nなんでも、有名なお店らしい……）", "zh": "（应春香的要求，我们来到了甜品店。\n听说是家很有名的店……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har02_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "bf69ed53080f9fa1b5ca239c3d126a8b60320c7307438744785a9f22873bf2ac", "ja": "わぁ……これ、すっごく美味しいですね！\nあんみつの、あんこの甘みが柔らかくて……。", "zh": "哇……这个真的太好吃了！\n馅蜜里的豆沙甜味很细腻温和……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har02_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "853c5865155a0aa4a1f59f7225b69a4ab35b0675ab28b13a1dcaa7484e0f2342", "ja": "抹茶アイスも甘さ控えめで、いくらでも食べられそう。\n{$P$}さんは、どうですか？", "zh": "抹茶冰淇淋的甜度也不高，感觉能吃多少都吃得下。\n{$P$}先生怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f334aec457a3b84676e0deee09874b9cc660ff7ad82431ddcdfd21b0a5a5e784", "ja": "うん、この生麩を使ったおまんじゅうも\n美味しいよ。", "zh": "嗯，这个用了生麸做成的馒头也\n很好吃哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har02_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "dcd74192502289251c661533ec43bd6966f1c4992669330b4cdb106fdbfab7c0", "ja": "ふふっ、本当ですね。{$P$}さん、\nすっごく美味しそうに食べてる！", "zh": "呵呵，真的呢。{$P$}先生，你吃得特别香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "af86e110de93f1c3352f29c64fc595d082a03db8b4e93ec215b83796d32fbb90", "ja": "いや、本当に美味しいから……。", "zh": "没有，是真的很好吃啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har02_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "6d2211e3fb59a7a2ac33799c7be4ea09da6494d7ca172bc8cfaae9ba67cacbdd", "ja": "でも、そっか。和菓子もありましたね。\nうーん、レパートリー増やそうかな……。", "zh": "不过，这么说来，和果子也可以呢。\n嗯——要不要增加一些种类呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har02_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "f37780d8c9df4c07ab4b450531a28b9575aa4b373e191c962ae70716d17214e0", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nこの後、本屋さんに寄ってもいいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n接下来可以去一趟书店吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "204a1bc7eb830ed9eb7b9bae2aef3fa935e579dc5d944b5ac21eee9442ce45f1", "ja": "もちろんいいけど……でも、\n旅先で本を買ったりして、荷物にならないか？", "zh": "当然可以……不过，\n在旅游的地方买书，行李不会变重吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har02_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "bc4a7312ab444034254d997426ab8311b734b2d170ed2d9a786b7bae25a70ab7", "ja": "大丈夫です！　……{$P$}さん、\n期待しててくださいね♪", "zh": "没问题的！……{$P$}先生，\n请好好期待一下哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7007e56b5184ad3400784f7803570a59ae7f6867cd7039329af6cba33de33ebd", "ja": "？　ああ、わかった。", "zh": "？啊，知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3ad8c064e99cf05006579e35df83d6a8b2c6fed04bc17a10e2b87fecf9d5b8ee", "ja": "（そして帰り道、春香は『金沢の和菓子』という\nレシピ本を買っていた。これはひょっとして……！？）", "zh": "（然后回去的路上，春香买了一本名为《金泽和果子》的食谱。这难道是……！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
